  "calibration": "2026-10-23: this version supersedes prereg-v4 before the paper-aligned formal matrix. It matches the manuscript: ten application sessions (five Artifex and five Tavern) plus one visible raw WebGPU pressure page, the full 0/250/500/750/1000/1500/2000/3000/4000/clear-return ladder, and four models. E2E-1 additionally records an exploratory click-response latency from seeded random tab switches to the second rendered animation frame; clicks do not change session priority. Task-quality judging and recovered-history consistency are outside the main E2E claims and are not gates. Prior run directories remain historical artifacts and are not merged into this protocol.",
